{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103023","id":2343476498,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Lrp0S","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103023","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103023.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103023.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103023","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103023/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103023/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103023/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/dfefb92f10d235d7a0eefd64878605fb051ffdde","number":103023,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix dynamic object light leaking in LightmapGI when Interior is enabled","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"When **Interior** is enabled, black out probes located near the LightmapGI's bounds so that dynamic objects don't receive lighting from them.\r\n\r\nNote that https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/83420 does not supersede this PR, as it never excludes the 8 probes located at the AABB's vertices which are required for probe interpolation to work. These probes cannot be removed, so instead, they need to be made black in interior scenes to avoid light leaks.\r\n\r\n- This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102949.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [lightmap-colors-3.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18856492/lightmap-colors-3.zip)\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\n### With no additional lightmap probes\r\n\r\nInterior *OFF* | Interior *ON*\r\n-|-\r\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4a5c2a16-15b2-40e9-947c-c168c009c251) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b23b999c-6e9e-43c0-b988-106121465cb6)\r\n\r\n### With emissive object and LightmapProbe nearby\r\n\r\nInterior *OFF* | Interior *ON*\r\n-|-\r\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0cea0f99-bc28-424a-801d-f1139e3c0a46) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7a0f9533-5fa0-4b60-92eb-9853b5dc57a8)\r\n\r\n### With emissive object, LightmapProbe nearby and sun\r\n\r\nInterior *OFF* | Interior *ON*\r\n-|-\r\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d1a8e1cc-347d-4ee7-b0f2-5434091c752d) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6f80558d-a037-4a0b-bbf8-d15b1658a1d0)\r\n\r\n#### Display of the probes in the editor\r\n\r\nInterior *OFF* | Interior *ON*\r\n-|-\r\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f31d9b52-0f95-4629-9949-db324aca3d66) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b602699e-25b0-4fca-9110-877efcb5fb14)\r\n\r\n#### With Generate Probes Subdiv = 4\r\n\r\nInterior *OFF* | Interior *ON*\r\n-|-\r\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/16e57ca3-16b4-405e-b8c1-047574a26670) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/47737c6b-7af1-435b-9e13-2de